{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-13-15","kind":"proposition","title":"作内接于球的正六面体","englishTitle":"To construct a cube and comprehend it in a sphere, like the pyramid; and to prove that the square on the diameter of the sphere is triple of the square on the side of the cube.","book":13,"number":15,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.15","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.15/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":15,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-13-15@raw-1f92fba359c5250a","contentId":"euclid-13-15","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1f92fba359c5250ac94e93c895d537bb84cd5a591bf19356e1bddc70aa80e930","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-13-15.statement","euclid-13-15.construction.1","euclid-13-15.proof.1","euclid-13-15.construction.2","euclid-13-15.proof.2","euclid-13-15.proof.3","euclid-13-15.proof.4","euclid-13-15.proof.5","euclid-13-15.proof.6","euclid-13-15.proof.7","euclid-13-15.proof.8","euclid-13-15.proof.9","euclid-13-15.proof.10","euclid-13-15.proof.11","euclid-13-15.proof.12","euclid-13-15.conclusion","euclid-13-15.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-13-15.statement","contentId":"euclid-13-15","revisionId":"euclid-13-15@raw-1f92fba359c5250a","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"18ffeff57fd4e5dd0db178bd246c12744e5f178422e05d2fbedbac66a752beb0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To construct a cube and comprehend it in a sphere, like the pyramid; and to prove that the square on the diameter of the sphere is triple of the square on the side of the cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"建造一个立方体, 并把它理解在一个球体, 像金字塔; 并证明正方形 球直径是3倍于正方形 立方体侧。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-15.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-13-15","revisionId":"euclid-13-15@raw-1f92fba359c5250a","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d9c231daa733a0919ca0d7af761f21c0dcb899ef1bb5f6bd55cc484dca2297f6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the diameter AB of the given sphere be set out, and let it be cut at C so that AC is double of CB; let the semicircle ADB be described on AB, let CD be drawn from C at right angles to AB, and let DB be joined; let the square EFGH having its side equal to DB be set out, from E, F, G, H let EK, FL, GM, HN be drawn at right angles to the plane of the square EFGH, from EK, FL, GM, HN let EK, FL, GM, HN respectively be cut off equal to one of the straight lines EF, FG, GH, HE, and let KL, LM, MN, NK be joined; therefore the cube FN has been constructed which is contained by six equal squares."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将特定球体的直径AB确定为C,AC是CB的两倍;将ADB半圆圈描述为AB,将CD从直角时的C射至AB时的CD,将DB连接为DB;将正方形 EFGH船的一侧等于DB船的距离从E、F、G船的距离从EK、FL、GM、HN船的距离从直角班次划到正方形 EFGH班次的平面班次,从EK、FL、GM、HN班次切断,从EF、FG、GH、HE班次的距离,到KL、LM、MN、NK班次的连线;因此,FN立方体是由6个等正方形组成的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-15.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-13-15","revisionId":"euclid-13-15@raw-1f92fba359c5250a","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f3f6abca39c553b9b45305c0c23d96ed47fc7e5ab6c954b791d3cc14fdd3ad0e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is then required to comprehend it in the given sphere, and to prove that the square on the diameter of the sphere is triple of the square on the side of the cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"然后,它必须理解它,在特定球体中,并证明球体直径的正方形是立方体侧的正方形的三倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-15.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-13-15","revisionId":"euclid-13-15@raw-1f92fba359c5250a","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"665e78f0e135a861a12e4a07137d1734d170428baf1eefc01e238917f38e43e9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let KG, EG be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"KG,EG连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-15.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-13-15","revisionId":"euclid-13-15@raw-1f92fba359c5250a","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5e59a68afcc8c779349786fce6e369ccec1628cf1f14c525e2728134864c69fe","citations":["euclid-11-def-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the angle KEG is right, because KE is also at right angles to the plane EG and of course to the straight line EG also, [[XI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-11-def-3)] therefore the semicircle described on KG will also pass through the point E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"KEG角是正确的,因为KE方向也是直角,平面方向是EG线,当然也到了EG线,因此KG线上所说的半圆圈也将通过E线。 [[XI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-11-def-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-15.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-13-15","revisionId":"euclid-13-15@raw-1f92fba359c5250a","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3cd6a5f738ec9ce51b8b17d83b037981f5302fca9fb36bbd8fd3c3ad23d5ece0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since GF is at right angles to each of the straight lines FL, FE, GF is also at right angles to the plane FK; hence also, if we join FK, GF will be at right angles to FK; and for this reason again the semicircle described on GK will also pass through F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于GF是FL、FE、GF是直角至平面 FK直线的每条直角,因此,如果我们连接FK,GF将是直角至FK;因此,GK中描述的半圆圈也将通过F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-15.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-13-15","revisionId":"euclid-13-15@raw-1f92fba359c5250a","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f92734c0b06660e1fa72bde03708ed95dbf55823411b291e12ff86ea54e05086","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly it will also pass through the remaining angular points of the cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,它也会穿过立方体的其余角点。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-15.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-13-15","revisionId":"euclid-13-15@raw-1f92fba359c5250a","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4ea9ef6f94da6163b7d907633b183248423ce3a9e341c8f189e6f672c833470b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If then, KG remaining fixed, the semicircle be carried round and restored to the same position from which it began to be moved, the cube will be comprehended in a sphere."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果届时KG剩余部分被固定,半圆圈被绕过,并恢复到开始移动的位置,则立方体将被一个球体所理解。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-15.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-13-15","revisionId":"euclid-13-15@raw-1f92fba359c5250a","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"48129c2fdbd648738aa04af8ef7c560d83ca3db1d9f3df0d0ff9a046400bc19a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also comprehended in the given sphere."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来我说,它也体现在特定领域。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-15.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-13-15","revisionId":"euclid-13-15@raw-1f92fba359c5250a","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"099840494ada16a24ed001d5b009aa3c7da703851c50f614b26ac6bfe7a42c5f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since GF is equal to FE, and the angle at F is right, therefore the square on EG is double of the square on EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为GF等于FE,F的角是正确的,因此EG的正方形是EF的正方形的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-15.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-13-15","revisionId":"euclid-13-15@raw-1f92fba359c5250a","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e1ef2090e4f52b774fb2435ff46adb5ffaedaec9d3a061c4a0866d3f1621e0d1","citations":["euclid-1-47"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But EF is equal to EK; therefore the square on EG is double of the square on EK; hence the squares on GE, EK, that is the square on GK [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)], is triple of the square on EK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但EF等于EK;因此,EG的正方形是EK的正方形的两倍;因此,GE的正方形,EK,即GK的正方形,是EK的正方形的三倍。 [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-15.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-13-15","revisionId":"euclid-13-15@raw-1f92fba359c5250a","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6093f407ca23fdf8ca24f39b5c2f8ed6f9ae55c676b6886f987827b9421efa71","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AB is triple of BC, while, as AB is to BC, so is the square on AB to the square on BD, therefore the square on AB is triple of the square on BD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB比BC是331,AB比AB等于正方形比正方形比BD,因此,AB比正方形是BD比正方形的三倍"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-15.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-13-15","revisionId":"euclid-13-15@raw-1f92fba359c5250a","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a6784777486956b12fa14747fc0f1e7b1f9faec5047985372bb39daf7912bdf1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on GK was also proved triple of the square on KE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但GK的正方形 也证明是正方形和KE的三倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-15.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-13-15","revisionId":"euclid-13-15@raw-1f92fba359c5250a","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"30f430a34b9d721e63ab6b6816526aa82f6744207535c99a86d6f9cade178757","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And KE was made equal to DB; therefore KG is also equal to AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"KE被定为DB,KG也等于AB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-15.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-13-15","revisionId":"euclid-13-15@raw-1f92fba359c5250a","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ccc92d91fbf88e673ed30873f349010ff45bfb8d1d0a4614eccd6e8dbe88b7dd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And AB is the diameter of the given sphere; therefore KG is also equal to the diameter of the given sphere."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB是给定球的直径, 因此KG 也等于给定球的直径。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-15.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-13-15","revisionId":"euclid-13-15@raw-1f92fba359c5250a","order":15,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9e2fe5b32be868921621ad9aa3a8224b8b2810a652c8d8dda9a84766f8f4862b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the cube has been comprehended in the given sphere; and it has been demonstrated at the same time that the square on the diameter of the sphere is triple of the square on the side of the cube. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,立方体已被特定球体所理解;同时,也证明了球体直径的正方形是立方体侧的正方形的三倍。 证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-15.source","contentId":"euclid-13-15","revisionId":"euclid-13-15@raw-1f92fba359c5250a","order":16,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b1aefd53a666fc8ba3f602993b07026bb1c85bdd968b07cbd6a45b4cff618675","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.15/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.15\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-13-15:euclid-11-def-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-15.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-def-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"XI. Def. 3"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-13-15:euclid-1-47:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-15.proof.8"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-47","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"I. 47"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-13-17:euclid-13-15:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-17","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-17.proof.30"],"targetContentId":"euclid-13-15","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.17","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.17/","sourceLabel":"XIII. 15"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-13-18:euclid-13-15:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-18","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-18.proof.8"],"targetContentId":"euclid-13-15","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.18","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.18/","sourceLabel":"XIII. 15"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-13-15:euclid-11-def-3:explicit","id":"euclid-11-def-3","book":11,"number":3,"kind":"definition","title":"直线垂直于平面","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-13-15:euclid-1-47:explicit","id":"euclid-1-47","book":1,"number":47,"kind":"proposition","title":"勾股定理：直角三角形斜边平方等于两直角边平方和","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-13-17:euclid-13-15:explicit","id":"euclid-13-17","book":13,"number":17,"kind":"proposition","title":"作内接于球的正十二面体","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-13-18:euclid-13-15:explicit","id":"e